need to keep your tummy full and outsmart the hunter by blending in on a map full of NPC Deer. And yes, you can actually fart…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708450/extras/1a814a8132e803d07c944da28fea50ff.avif?t=1792166826\" width=1000 height=125 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708450/extras/b83e8433d4b66c45e079284823aefc4c.poster.avif?t=1792166826\" width=1030 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708450/extras/b83e8433d4b66c45e079284823aefc4c.webm?t=1792166826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708450/extras/b83e8433d4b66c45e079284823aefc4c.mp4?t=1792166826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track, Hunt, and Chase the Deer! Use your hunting skills and abilities to figure out which deer are acting a little too human. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: Do NOT get confused with the NPC deer!   Once your sanity is gone, you’ve got a much bigger problem…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708450/extras/d7e02e1e36e29d06e4f32fb59aa1e472.avif?t=1792166826\" width=1000 height=125 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708450/extras/b98574396d4e85c13845944f758e1660.poster.avif?t=1792166826\" width=1030 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708450/extras/b98574396d4e85c13845944f758e1660.webm?t=1792166826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708450/extras/b98574396d4e85c13845944f758e1660.mp4?t=1792166826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the <strong>hunter loses their sanity</strong> by hunting the <strong>wrong deer</strong> or <strong>taking too long</strong> it’s time for the <strong>player deer</strong> to <strong>hunt the Hunter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SPOILER… you don't want to be the hunter.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708450/extras/2b1556d1cace1a599675d682f4b1929f.avif?t=1792166826\" width=1000 height=125 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708450/extras/21c92c66f5907425b5e1f7c13fbad2b8.poster.avif?t=1792166826\" width=1030 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708450/extras/21c92c66f5907425b5e1f7c13fbad2b8.webm?t=1792166826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708450/extras/21c92c66f5907425b5e1f7c13fbad2b8.mp4?t=1792166826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on 8 different maps forcing you to adapt to each environment. Find your favorite hiding spots and learn your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708450/extras/ee25955005e5794a54b9c6e0b7835354.avif?t=1792166826\" width=1000 height=125 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_u